  "unreadV2": {
    "notes": [
      "Version-2 unread record: d=read-state-unread-v2:<32 lowercase hex>, t=read-state-unread-v2, plaintext {\"v\":2,\"client_id\",\"contexts\"}. Each group travels with its channel frontier.",
      "Stamps are uint32 Unix seconds. Lifetime 2592000 s; discard guard 600 s; receive defers a group more than 660 s ahead; allocation is refused more than 60 s ahead or past uint32.",
      "Clock checks inspect max(S,C), never B or created_at. Version-1 override keys are never imported."
    ],
